# Logs (structured, processed logs are tracked as the forensic audit trail;
# raw API cache is not). app.log is the exception: free-text, locally
# rotated/capped at 5MB x 3 backups (shared/utils/logger.py) — tracking it
# is redundant with those local backups and was producing large, noisy
# diffs that buried real code changes (2026-08-23 full model audit finding).
# The structured CSVs (audit_log/validation_log/override_log/performance_
# log/trade_outcomes/fill_log) stay tracked; only the free-text log doesn't.
data/logs/app.log*
data/raw/
data/historical/

# Desktop app UI — local scan history (App_UI_Scope.md), regenerated per machine
stockanalysis_history.db
